*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.vmdk
*.ova
*.ovf
*.sav

Snapshots/
Logs/

*.vbox-prev
*.vbox-tmp

# Keep VirtualBox machine configuration out of the repository
*.vbox

# ------------------------------------------------------------
